   "id": "37/O1",
   "goal": "Explain how contextual inquiry findings can be turned into documented usability requirements, from design guidelines to a functional requirements hierarchy.",
   "achieves": "It lets the learner move from observed user context to structured, implementable requirements for an XR system.",
